msgctxt "7532"
msgid "Yamashiro Express"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7550"
msgid "Mail Box"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7559"
msgid ""
"Letters to Kiryu are delivered to this box. The box glows when a new "
"message has been delivered. Check the box from time to time for new mail. "
"You have to take a letter from the box before you can read it. Special "
"deliveries may also be made by carrier pigeon. Large packages are delivered "
"by couriers. Thank you for using Yamashiro Express!"
msgstr ""

