msgctxt "8782"
msgid "Mack"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8787"
msgid "A Smack of Mack! <Color:1><Sign:48><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8838"
msgid ""
"How's it swinging, Kiryu-san? Just wanted to fill you in on some juicy "
"deets I slurped up the other day. <Color:1><Sign:16><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8977"
msgid ""
"You know Hatsumachi, yeah? Tons of interesting-looking people roaming "
"around there, lemme tell you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9077"
msgid ""
"Speaking of, there's this old dude you might wanna try to find! Just "
"concentrate real hard once you do to take in the glory! (Word on the street "
"is, you gotta press the  "
"<Color:1><Action:Button_R3@Adventure><Color:Default> to concentrate!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9317"
msgid "Mack's Back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9330"
msgid ""
"Surf's up, Kiryu-san! That's how the bros in California say hello. Anyway, "
"Japanese is kinda tough! My girlfriend's been teaching me, but I just end "
"up using all sorts of weird words. Hope you don't mind if I unleash some of "
"my practice on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9575"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'll hit you up whenever I get some sweet deets on the perfect "
"shot. Stay tuned for more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9673"
msgid "Oh, and don't forget to upload your shots to a blog!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9726"
msgid "The Scent of Mack<Color:1><Sign:49><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9777"
msgid ""
"Sorry for getting you all tied up earlier, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default> But man, you don't waste any time getting "
"what you want! <Color:1><Sign:21><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9955"
msgid ""
"By the way, my girlfriend's been hammering more and more Japanese into my "
"brainhole, so I think I'm getting pretty good! Mind if I keep practicing "
"with you? <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10145"
msgid ""
"And before I forget, I got news for you! There are rumors floating around "
"town like a pungent fart⑬some sauced up thugs have been pretending to pole "
"dance outside of Club Asia! You know, the bikini bar!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10350"
msgid ""
"I hear you gotta go inside and watch the show first, then you can walk out "
"and watch another!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10444"
msgid "Mack in Action"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10459"
msgid "Here I am for all your photo needs, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10506"
msgid ""
"So, one of my boys told me about this beauty he's been eyeballing, girl "
"called the Judo Girl over on Tenkaichi Street in Kamurocho! Just look for a "
"broad in a school uniform and glasses, and that's your girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10715"
msgid ""
"Anyways, my friend was macking on her real hard, not taking no for an "
"answer... when suddenly she just picked him up and tossed him flat on his "
"ass! <Color:1><Sign:12><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10898"
msgid ""
"Man, I can picture it now! She's like some kinda wild beast behind those "
"bookworm glasses, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10999"
msgid "Bet she'd make a dang good shot if you ever find yourself up there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11067"
msgid "Peace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11074"
msgid "Mack in the House!<Color:1><Sign:16><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11126"
msgid ""
"My Japanese is getting better with every breath I take of this sweet "
"Japanese air, Kiryu-san! Probably helps that I've been spending mad time "
"with my girl, too. I love her to pieces, lemme tell you, but she kiiinda "
"texts me way too much? <Color:1><Sign:10><Color:Default> Least I'm getting "
"lots of Japanese practice! <Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11477"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I saw these lovebirds over at the Kamurocho batting cages, and I "
"got this feeling the guy's gonna do something you don't wanna miss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11618"
msgid ""
"Btdubs you ever hear of dumb love? It's like, where you're so in love with "
"someone, you act like an idiot around them! That's what those two at the "
"batting cages are like! Me and my girl, too. "
"<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11844"
msgid "Nothing But Mack! <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11895"
msgid ""
"Heyo, Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default> Lemme cut to the chase: "
"I got another shot for you. <Color:1><Sign:47><Color:Default> There's this "
"rocking soba joint in the southeast part of Kamurocho, but the owner's "
"totally bonkers. <Color:1><Sign:35><Color:Default> Apparently his noodles "
"suffer for it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12205"
msgid ""
"Anyways, keep your eyeballs trained on that owner and your chance'll come "
"in no time flat! Probably when he hops on his bike, if I had to guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12350"
msgid "All Mack, All the Time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12374"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! Hope you're swinging through the jungle of life like a monkey "
"hopped up on banana juice! Anyways, I just got word the bowling alley in "
"Kamurocho's a hotspot for weird shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12558"
msgid ""
"I dunno if there's a grain of truth to that, but you might wanna go take a "
"peek! <Color:1><Sign:13><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12673"
msgid ""
"Btdubs, I've been learning a ton of Japanese from this DVD I picked up the "
"other day. I had no idea you could use tentacles for THAT!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12807"
msgid "Mack in Motion! <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12857"
msgid "Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12901"
msgid ""
"There's this whiny little kid always begging his poor papa to buy him a toy "
"over on Park Boulevard, but his dad always shuts him down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13036"
msgid ""
"I thought they were tights on funds so I offered to buy something for the "
"little tyke, but his dad blew a gasket! Nearly punched my lights out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13180"
msgid ""
"I guess people don't like getting told how to parent! "
"<Color:1><Sign:11><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13268"
msgid ""
"Anyways, kids and Kamurocho are like oil and water! It's the perfect "
"contradiction that might just lead to the perfect shot! Peace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13400"
msgid "Crouching Tiger, Hidden Mack"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13429"
msgid "Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13473"
msgid ""
"The perfect shot's practically staring me in the face these days, and I "
"like how it looks! Pretty sure I'm gonna beat you to the punch, haha! "
"<Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13648"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I heard this little tidbit and just had to share: Apparently "
"there's a ninja in Kamurocho handing out tissue packs on Nakamichi Street! "
"It's like we're extras in a real life samurai flick! Man, what I'd give to "
"be on the silver screen, see my name up in lights... I can just imagine it "
"now. Mack, Bigger, Better, and Badder!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13981"
msgid ""
"Well, good luck getting a shot of that ninja! Hope she's not too quick for "
"your shutter!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14070"
msgid "A Finely-Aged Mack <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14123"
msgid ""
"Wassup, Kiryu-san! <Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default> Word on the street is, "
"you've been busting heads left and right down in Okinawa! How do I know? I "
"just do, haha! Don't ask a man to share his secrets! "
"<Color:1><Sign:43><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14361"
msgid ""
"Btdubs, I've been peeping this yakuza series on TV lately, and it's off the "
"hook!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14443"
msgid ""
"But that's not what I wanted to tell you. Pal of mine down in Okinawa says "
"there's some asshole plastered out of his mind over in Hatsumachi! And "
"lemme tell you, not all drunks are created equal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14639"
msgid ""
"Turns out this guy isn't just any old boozer, he also knows some real "
"badass martial arts moves! What a combination, right!? Speaking of, you "
"ever hear of the movie Drinking Tiger? It's all about that kickass martial "
"artist Wong Fei Sung!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14878"
msgid "Anyway, hop over to Hatsumachi and check this guy out when you get the time!"
msgstr ""

