msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14990"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've been selected to test our company's brand new Super "
"IH Water Purifier. Simply fill out a short survey for us, and the Super IH "
"Water Purifier is yours! Please visit us at the address below so we can "
"tell about our product and its installation procedure. Since this is our "
"latest and greatest model, supplies are limited to the first 30 customers "
"who stop by."
msgstr ""

