msgstr ""

msgctxt "15449"
msgid "Temp"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15454"
msgid "Violence Tobita stopped by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15482"
msgid ""
"Thank you. The thugs nearly pissed their pants when they saw Tobita. Still, "
"if they come back in numbers, I doubt even he could handle them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15623"
msgid ""
"There's a guy named Iwakuma at the stew shop on East Shichifuku Street. "
"He's training to be a sumo wrestler, but he's too wild to go pro. Still, "
"his wild side could make him a good bouncer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15813"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't mind going over to meet Iwakuma and seeing if he's bouncer "
"material, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15906"
msgid ""
"That Iwakuma is out of control. He actually picked a fight with Tobita when "
"he came to the Dragon Palace. Tobita's a cut above him, so it wasn't long "
"till he sent Iwakuma flying, but nevertheless, Iwakuma's pretty good "
"himself. Thank you so much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16153"
msgid ""
"This homeless fellow who lives behind Millennium Tower told me something "
"interesting. It seems there's this former yakuza who left his family and "
"went into hiding. Since my enemy's enemy is my ally, I'd like for you to "
"get him to be my bouncer. In exchange, I'll guarantee his anonymity. "
"Supposedly, you can find him in an alley on Tenkaichi St."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16499"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't mind finding this former yakuza and seeing if he's bouncer "
"material, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16592"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for persuading Nanba-san to be my bouncer. When it comes "
"to yakuza, it takes one to know one. Thanks to Nanba-san, I can now get "
"things done with fewer fights. Win without fighting! That's the way to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16814"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, those thugs still haven't stopped harassing us here at the "
"casino. They've even started threatening us with stun guns and even real "
"guns. And the owner of the bikini bar over on Pink St., who happens to be "
"an old friend of mine, said they're being harassed by some kind of stalker. "
"It seems he's a hardcore weapons nut, so the owner's too scared to chase "
"the guy away. Now, if you could recruit him, we could kill two birds with "
"one stone. The bikini bar would be safe again, and my casino would get "
"another formidable bouncer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17357"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't mind going over to Pink St. and trying to recruit that weapons "
"freak for me, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17458"
msgid ""
"That weapons nut Hirano stopped by. He's been so busy tinkering with our "
"weapons here at the Dragon Palace that he's forgotten all about the girls "
"at the bikini bar, and the owner of the place is so thankful for our help. "
"The only problem is Hirano is collecting the strangest weapons you've ever "
"seen. We have no idea how to use them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "17794"
msgid ""
"We're almost rid of those thugs thanks to all the bouncers you've recruited "
"for us. I think just one more would do the trick. And there just so happens "
"to be a guy I've had my eyes on. His name is Gatling Sendo. He was pro "
"boxer, but he got banned from competition because he was just too strong. "
"If the Dragon Palace could get him, you wouldn't have to recruit any more "
"bouncers for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18182"
msgid ""
"I hear he's been losing himself in booze and babes since he was banned. A "
"good place to start is MEB⑬you know, the place that provides info on "
"Kamurocho. Get him and your job's done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18367"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, Gatling Sendo came by. I was glad to see he's still as big and "
"strong as when he was pulverizing opponents in the ring. Looks to me like "
"he's been training as hard as ever. He even mentioned he wants to get back "
"into the ring someday. And since I'm an expert on forging IDs and creating "
"new identities, I think I might oblige him! Should be a piece of cake. "
"Besides, I'm a huge fan of Sendo's. I get chills up my spine just thinking "
"about seeing him pulverizing his opponents again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18861"
msgid ""
"Now that we have five bouncers, we should be able to deal with any thugs "
"that come our way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "18953"
msgid ""
"I'd like to thank you, so please stop by the casino when you have a moment. "
"Hope to see you soon."
msgstr ""

