msgctxt "37649"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! I'm the queen of part-time work! I started a new job at "
"Gelateria Kamurocho. I'm really excited about it cause I love ice cream! "
"<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37822"
msgid "Come see me sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37844"
msgid "Found a new job!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "37861"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-saaaan! I just got a part-time job at a bowling alley! I should be "
"okay this time because there's no food involved. I'm at Mach Bowl on "
"Theater Alley. I know it's gonna work out this "
"time!<Color:1><Sign:4><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38088"
msgid "Crash and burn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38104"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-saaaan! I interviewed at a hostess club, but I ended up answering "
"every question wrong! I've gotta work a little bit harder. I'll email you "
"again once I find another job! Talk to you later!  "
"<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38334"
msgid "Stop by!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38343"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-saaaan! I got a job! Do you know the bar Earth Angel in the Champion "
"District? I'll be working there! Come stop by! "
"<Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38498"
msgid "Figured it out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38514"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-saaaan! I figured it all out! I know what I want to do! For the first "
"time since coming here! I feel bad for the Mama at Earth Angel, but this "
"isn't where I need to be. I talked to her, and she told me to follow my "
"heart! She's cheering me on! So I'm heading off! I hope I get to see you "
"again somewhere, someday! <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38867"
msgid "Ayaka Tsubaki"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38881"
msgid "Thank you<Color:1><Sign:3><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "38923"
msgid ""
"Thanks for giving me advice. Afterwards, I told Kentaro-san how I felt. His "
"response... Well, we're dating now. <Color:1><Sign:1><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39068"
msgid ""
"He knew about my past already. Sounds like he overheard when I was talking "
"about it to my manager at the shop. He told me he didn't know how to tell "
"me about how serious he was about me! <Color:1><Sign:0><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "39288"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad I got your advice, Kiryu-san! I'll treat you next time you stop "
"by the shop. <Color:1><Sign:1><Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

